  "description": "A form of internet humor that uses irony, exaggeration, or absurdity to critique or mock a subject. This meme uses the juxtaposition of a real-world insect swarm with a ludicrous government conspiracy to create humor and provoke skepticism about baseless theories. It is a common meme format used to expose the illogical nature of certain conspiracy narratives.",
